s, she goes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Voiced <span class=\\\"strong\\\">(yes)</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"watches, bridges, he watches\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Saturday"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the sixth day of the week"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Julie cleans the house on Saturdays."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob04aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear in the dialogue between Julie and Amy. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shopping"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "getting things in a store in exchange for money"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to go grocery shopping."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob04aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "quick"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "moving fast"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The train is quick."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob04aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "time"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a quantity measured in hours and minutes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What time is it?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob04aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "plaza"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a shopping center"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We go to the plaza to buy shoes."}, {"t